WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:05.000
<i>1999. As the century passes...</i>

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.260
<i>The earth and space will continue onward into a new era.</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.440
<i>In this world...</i>

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.320
<i>Something from a forgotten history has been found.</i>

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.620
<i>And that is, Turn A.</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.470
<i>Here are some hints on how you can survive when entering the 21st Century.</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.550
<i>TURN</i>

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:30.010
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:30.930
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:31.930
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:32.720
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:33.800
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.180
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.720
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.060
<b><i>#ENCODERGASM PRESENTS</i></b>

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:45.060
<i>toki ga mirai ni susumu to dare ga kimeta no da?</i>

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:45.060
<b>Who decided that time should move forward towards the future?</b>

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>rakuin o kesu inochi ga rekishi o kakinaosu</i>

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:51.650
<b>The lives that will erase these brands will rewrite history</b>

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:59.030
<b>Everything About TURN A</b>

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.580
<i>The key word of this story is the Dark History.</i>

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:05.620
<i>This Dark History took place somewhere around 2000 years ago.</i>

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:10.340
<i>A legacy traced from the present to the earth's humble beginnings. The legend of the unknown past.</i>

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.250
<i>Let us open the pages of this legend...</i>

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.550
<i>...and explore the dark mysteries that were sealed.</i>

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:18.010
<i>First Chapter
"Mobile Suits"</i>

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:22.770
<i>At that time, a few of us from the Moonrace had been given a mission...</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.810
<i>...to come and experience the earth.</i>

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:31.730
Everyone...

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.820
...the earth is a very good place!

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:39.820
Hurry up and come back!
The earth is a very good place!

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:44.330
Everyone, Hurry up and come back!

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:50.000
<i>Loran Cehack - He made his living as a worker...</i>

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.540
<i>...and as a servant of the Heim Family.</i>

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:56.130
Why do Earth people always look at what's above them, but never at what's below?

00:01:56.130 --> 00:01:58.510
Because they can't get off the ground.

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.600
Hey, what are you two gonna do when the Return begins?

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:04.350
I don't really want to live with the Returners.

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:06.230
I'm gonna keep learning how to bake.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:08.230
I want to make bread for everyone.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.810
I'll become a newspaper journalist!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:15.230
<i>Those who came with Loran:
A Baker's apprentice, Keith Laijie...</i>

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:18.030
<i>...and the news reporter, Fran Doll.</i>

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:21.450
I've stopped...

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.620
Sochie! Congrats on your first solo flight!

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:27.620
Sochie, even though you're a girl of the Heim family, you want to be a Militia pilot. You're special as well.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.830
I'll leave the inheritance stuff to my sister.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:34.800
I don't want to end up as the wife of some politician or merchant.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.340
<i>Sochie Heim</i>

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:39.930
<i>The younger daughter of the Heim family, an energetic girl who enjoys flying in planes.</i>

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.640
How's the University?

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.640
I won't know until school begins.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:49.440
They'll just be teaching me things I already know. I want to be part of society.

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:52.020
What nonsense are you speaking of?

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.150
I don't have any interest in going to college to learn some useless theories.

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:57.220
In this era, I'd rather learn practical things and contribute as a member of society.

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:59.060
<i>Kihel Heim</i>

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:01.240
<i>Elder daughter of the Heim Family...</i>

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:04.330
A lovely looking girl whose appearance closely resembles the Moon's Queen, Dianna Soriel.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.830
Are you sure that we're really going to war?

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:08.330
That's just a rumor.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:12.330
Then again, this could be precisely the opportunity I've sought to help industrialize this society.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.420
That's the heir for you.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:18.420
You're using your position as your family's heir to advance development and production.

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:22.150
My father was a politician and a diplomat, and thus so am I.

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:23.850
<i>Guin Rhineford</i>

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:26.350
<i>Current heir of the leaders of Inglessa...</i>

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:28.850
<i>...who seeks to industrialize the region.</i>

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.940
<i>On the day of Vicinity's Coming of Age festival...</i>

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:39.240
And now, as the one chosen to stand before the White Doll, I shall now begin the Holy Carving Ceremony.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.240
Who among you wants to go up with me?

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:45.830
<i>In the Radio monitoring room of Bostonia Castle, they received a message.</i>

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:50.250
<i>We receive signals from the Moonrace with them.</i>

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:53.620
You mean there's a race of people living on the moon?

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:57.930
I've organized the militia because they plan on immigrating here.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:03:59.340
It's not just Inglessa.

00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:02.720
They want me to hand over most of North Ameria's Sunbelt Zone.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:06.350
That's the demand of these spacelings who were living on the moon.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:15.980
l was there with Milady Sochie, standing before the White Doll on that mountain.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.440
I-if I don't do this, you won't become an adult...

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:23.740
We had begun the coming of age ceremony, but then...

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:26.820
What?

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:28.120
That's the color of fire!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.620
It really is fire!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:33.330
It's definitely coming from the direction of Nocis city! It's a huge blaze!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:38.340
The Moonrace's technological tools had begun an attack on Nocis city.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.220
What? Are these people serious!?

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:46.510
What annoying pests!

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.930
It's running...

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.600
But it seems to be a machine.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:54.230
<i>The Inglessa Militia rushed to counterattack, however...</i>

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:58.230
You barbarians...
DON'T TOY WITH ME!

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:04.110
<i>The pilot of the Mobile Suit WaDom, Lieutenant Poe, opened fire on and destroyed much of Nocis City.</i>

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:14.330
<i>At that moment, the stone statue of the White Doll crumbled...</i>

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.330
<i>...and revealed a Mechanical Doll residing within.</i>

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:23.840
What in the world happened!?

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:25.220
l don't know.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:27.720
The White-Doll crumbled all around us.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:29.680
What's that!?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.220
There's the seat.

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.430
This is definitely a driver's seat.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.520
It's got an MET interface...

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.310
But the control panel is much different.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:59.630
There was a mechanical doll inside the White Doll?

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.840
That seems to be it.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.210
This is a Mobile Suit!

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:06.420
How did a mobile suit become part of an ancient ruin?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.840
Sochie, Get down!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:16.810
It fired!

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.520
It's moving on its own. I can't stop it!

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.520
- Stop it!
- How!?

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.320
The earth shouldn't have any Mobile Suits!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:41.330
<i>After that, Sir Guin began holding negotiations between the Earth and Moon's representatives at his palace.</i>

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:44.050
I want the people of Dianna Counter to know...

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:49.130
I hereby ask you to disregard any of the radio communications we had with Dianna Counter over the past two years.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:54.930
So you refuse to acknowledge the fact that there is a race of humans, the Moonrace, living on the moon?

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:59.810
What I am trying to say is that we no longer possess any such knowledge of the Moonrace or your technology.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:03.150
So you barbarians wish to face us with barbaric methods?

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:06.110
Unfortunately, I'm not quite so sure that's how I would word it.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:13.120
<i>Harry Ord:
The Commander of Queen of the Moon, Dianna Soriel's, Royal Guard.</i>

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:20.120
<i>It was Harry and his Mobile Suit SUMO who acted as an escort...</i>

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:24.320
<i>...For the Dianna Counter flagship, the Soleil, as it landed at Nocis' airport.</i>

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.840
<i>Queen Dianna personally landed on the Earth.</i>

00:07:33.840 --> 00:07:35.640
l am Dianna Soriel.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.520
You must be Guin Sard Rhineford.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:43.230
Yes, Your Majesty Dianna Soriel.

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.010
You may rise.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.190
<i>Dianna Soriel:
The Queen of the Moonrace.</i>

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.820
<i>The leader of the Dianna Counter forces who issues orders from within the ship that landed on Earth.</i>

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.030
I am Loran Cehack.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:59.410
Born November 2nd, 2328 Correct Century, in the Meizan region.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:03.830
Upon graduating middle school, I was sent here to Earth on FLAT Unit Two.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:06.630
You've done a fine job over the past two years.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:10.050
It appears that you're healthy both mentally and physically.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:13.630
I'd never heard any rumors suggesting Mobile Suits were in Vicinity.

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:15.930
But...on the night of the Summer Solstice's Coming of Age Ceremony...

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.850
...the WaDom fired while we were at the Mountain Cycle, and then...

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:22.520
...the stone statue, "White-Doll" broke apart...

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.940
...and a Mobile Suit came out of it.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:31.030
What do you know about the Dark History? All this talk about tales of their great Gods?

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.530
Art representing it could be found in their children's books...

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:36.240
- But...
- But?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:38.330
A man named Sid said that he would be able to dig up some space weapons...

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:41.830
...that would prove the existence of the Dark History.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:45.330
He's an old man who has been mining everywhere in the mountains for the Militia soldiers.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:49.550
Guin Rhineford is ordering them to keep digging.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.130
The first mobile suit that we uncovered was the mustached suit, "Gundam".

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:56.140
Why was it hidden within the statue of the White Doll...

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:59.510
And just why did randomly counterattack against Dianna Counter's return forces?

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.430
These things, I'm afraid I do not know.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:04.560
Is that the Mustache's manual book?

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.730
The Dark History showed records of electronic books like this one.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:09.820
One like this, you mean?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.940
There are many unpredictable things hiding...

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.470
...within that twenty meter tall machine.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.410
Turn A Gundam: 
Spec One...

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.330
The Cockpit.

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:25.250
In order to enter the cockpit, you must use the lift.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.920
Originally, the unit was controlled through the use of the V.R. MET...

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:35.420
...which would then show you visual images through the Turn-A's canopy monitor, and you move the unit with the foot pedals and control arm.

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:38.190
W.A.D.!

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.930
Spec Two: 
The Chest.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:44.850
The frame is an uneven and disjointed component with several compartments for weapon storage.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:48.150
The frame's main structure is supported by the cross shaped section in the center.

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:54.440
Spec Three: 
The Shoulders.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:57.150
The arm's movement can be used to pull out a special beam saber...

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:00.410
...which can be used like a laser cutter to slice through just about anything.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:11.920
Spec Four: 
The Legs.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:16.720
I'm not going to fall!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:21.010
The Rear Legs open to reveal a system...

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:23.600
...that allows a mobile suit to fly, regardless of its posture.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.600
I am one of the Moonrace...

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.520
But now, I am with the people of Earth.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:32.360
By operating the Turn A Gundam...

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.310
I fight against the Mobile Suits used by the people of the moon.

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:41.450
WaDom VS. Gundam

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.540
Did we destroy it?

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:49.580
Above us!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.130
The earth is not a place to start a war!

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.400
What!?

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.410
Poe...Think of something!

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:04.140
I don't know what to do!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:11.180
SUMO vs. Gundam

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.920
Since then, we found other Mobile Suits.

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:44.430
There's the FLAT Loran and his friends from the moon used when they first landed on Earth.

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:48.930
Then the Militia battles the Dianna Counter by using this machine they excavated, the Kapool.

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:53.360
But the most recently uncovered find...

00:11:53.360 --> 00:11:55.230
...was this old Mobile Suit.

00:11:55.810 --> 00:12:00.820
Perhaps you the viewer recognizes it. It's appearance strongly resembles that of the Zaku from "First Gundam".

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:02.450
The Borjarnon.

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.240
You can take your break once we've finished uncovering the main body!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.830
Many weapons and mobile suits have now been excavated.

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:13.620
And just why are there so many things such as these hidden underground?

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:16.340
For now, that remains a mystery.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:31.930
Second Chapter: "Dianna and Kihel"

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.400
These two here gave me quite the surprise...

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:39.440
...since Queen Dianna and Milady Kihel's appearances are practically identical.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:43.450
Are you left handed?

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:46.820
No. I am like a mirror before you.

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.620
My my, Queen Dianna.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:13:00.340
The two of us look exactly the same.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.420
I must admit, I'd noticed the exact same thing.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.220
Miss Kihel...

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:08.140
Could I have you try on my outfit as well?

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:10.220
You want me to wear your gown, Queen Dianna?

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.350
That's right, please do.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.020
Sure.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:17.440
That's the last piece.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.820
Could you please turn around for me?

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:25.240
Miran, let us continue surveying the sights. Please accompany me.

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:32.830
You're exactly like the real thing,  Miss Kihel.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.830
From this point on,
...Kihel will be Dianna Soriel...

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.040
And I will be Kihel Heim.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.130
What should we do if someone discovers the truth?

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.840
If that happens, then we'll apologize to them for it.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.510
While they originally did this as a simple game of sorts...

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.010
When Queen Dianna and Milady Kihel changed identities...

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:52.140
It would also end up altering both of their destinies.

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:55.520
This is also my first time riding a vehicle like this.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.730
Be careful how you speak. Remember, you are Dianna Soriel.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.150
You have to carry yourself with grace.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:05.030
With grace, huh? You mean I need to use a more authoritative tone?

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.240
I'm not sure if I can do it.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:10.240
And then... at the Heim's place...

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:14.040
You finally made it back! It's been so long and you've been so busy...

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.270
This summer holiday's been a long one, hasn't it?

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:19.830
Yes it has. There's been too much homework, so l couldn't make it back before this.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:21.340
Mother...

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:24.050
Is everything going well at college?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:27.840
Yes, I've made several friends there..

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.140
I'm sorry to have called you all the way back here.

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:31.430
No.

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.220
Mother...

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:37.520
Your father left for the mountains to try and improve productivity in the mines.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.150
For the sake of our leader...

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:43.650
The war I've instigated is against people like this...?

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:49.240
Your hands are very warm, Kihel.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.450
Thank you very much, mother.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.370
Milady Kihel...

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.410
Oh father, I'm so very sorry!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:00.920
I'm sorry that it took so long for me to come back...

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:04.840
It's just that I have been kept so very busy by my work.

00:15:04.840 --> 00:15:09.880
I really am terribly sorry, father. Please understand this and be at peace...

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.850
Dianna Soriel...

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:15.140
Thank you so much.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:21.520
That...That really did come from deep within your heart, didn't it?

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:26.020
And so, Queen Dianna became Milady Kihel...

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.990
and stayed with me at the Heim's home...

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:31.530
And now Queen Dianna, while living the life of Milady Kihel...

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:36.120
I simply remembered that this was a very beautiful place.

00:15:37.240 --> 00:15:39.040
l too like the view here quite a bit.

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:43.040
Do all of the people from the moon feel the same way about it?

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:46.420
I certainly hope they do.

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.050
You're right.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:55.140
Elsewhere, Milady Kihel was also still pretending to be Queen Dianna...

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:58.350
- You mean the Soleil should?
- I mean all of our forces.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.810
What do you think, Queen Dianna?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.940
Are you sure about that?

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:08.190
We must also consider the safety of the populous that's returned here.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:10.240
That is true, and yet...

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:12.610
You want this?

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:13.990
Please allow me to borrow it.

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:15.450
Kihel Heim...

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.830
A lady like yourself shouldn't be using a device like that.

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.420
Corin Nander!

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:25.830
Her Majesty!?

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.630
Milady Kihel?

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.550
You have not obeyed my order!

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.130
I, Dianna Soriel now have no other choice. You are sentenced to death!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:36.930
They are not only like twins in the way that they look...

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.850
...but even in the ways that they think.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:41.810
As time passes, Queen Dianna becomes more like Milady Kihel...

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:44.020
...while Milady Kihel becomes more like Queen Dianna.

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:46.440
- Pass on this order.
- Yes Ma'am!

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.020
The air troops!

00:16:52.030 --> 00:16:54.030
Queen Dianna, please leave this place!

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:56.740
Don't worry about me.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:17:01.040
If it has come to war, then I am responsible for being on the front and taking command of my people.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:03.410
Ready the Soleil for launch!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:04.540
Right!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:08.130
Queen Dianna...is this really what you wanted?

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:12.840
Will these two ever be able to return to their rightful places...

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:15.430
...or are these their true forms?

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:21.520
Third Chapter:
The romances of Loran and the others.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:24.430
Just as it had once done in space...

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.940
...romance blossoms everywhere on the earth.

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.150
Mary had a little lamb...

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.450
It has nothing to do with the people of the earth, nor the people of the moon.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.030
Even in my case, I have long since admired someone.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.620
Queen Dianna Soriel.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:49.130
It was a major shock when I realized that Milady Kihel resembled Queen Dianna so closely.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:56.220
Dianna is a magnificent person, and many of her own people admire her.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.720
You brought Queen Dianna's...

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.470
It's a copy. Just a copy.

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:04.020
When Her Majesty Dianna arrives...do you think that she can calm this matter down?

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:07.140
And when Queen Dianna finally landed...

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:08.730
Queen Dianna!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.150
It's really her!

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:13.610
I was so excited when I was told...

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.820
...that I would finally be able to meet her myself.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.330
War is the last thing any of us here wish for.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.750
Then, if possible, you intend to do whatever you can to ensure the Earth and Moon coexist peacefully?

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:33.960
Of course. While the two of us may be on opposing sides, I believe that we both share this desire.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:36.840
And as for Kihel's reversal with Queen Dianna...

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.800
...But you spoiled that.

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:42.600
She was once rather cold towards me, but now that demeanor has started to change.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.470
What is it?

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.140
The sky, the clouds, and the wind...

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.440
l want everyone to be able to see and feel them as well.

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:51.150
Loran!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.110
Are you alright?

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:00.530
Your arm.

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:01.950
It's really nothing.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.240
What would you do if that wound of yours got infected?

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.540
Why is Milady Kihel...

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.710
You're suddenly being too kind to me...

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:14.130
Get back!

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:20.930
The fight is still going on out there.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:23.010
The war is still expanding...

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.720
Ouch...

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:28.810
Please, pardon me!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:35.940
You've done an excellent job. You continually surprise me.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:37.440
Really?

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.610
You should probably rest for awhile.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.830
And yet just when the two of us finally had a chance to relax...

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:53.470
...she ended up meeting a person who was once very important to her.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.340
Umm...

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:04.320
How insolent!

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:07.930
Mr. Will Game wanted to find out about the romantic legend of his ancestor...

00:20:07.930 --> 00:20:11.020
...and excavated a spacecraft in hopes that he would be able to fly it to the moon.

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.480
You're...

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:17.230
Huh? Can I help you?

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.740
...Will Game! That's who you are, right?

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.320
And who are you?

00:20:22.320 --> 00:20:24.780
I'm Dianna Soriel...

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:25.450
Dianna?

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:27.120
Will...

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.830
Dianna Soriel?

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:30.830
Meanwhile, I also...

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:33.540
Was this also dug out from the mountain?

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:38.210
At first Teteth Hallah seemed to be Will's wife...

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:40.420
...but she was in fact, a mysterious and seductive woman.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:42.550
I just touched it and it opened.

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.930
Hey, how do you know how to operate this Mechanical Doll?

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:49.640
Please tell me all about it!

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:50.930
It's a hot spring!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:52.100
That's right.

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:55.940
You, come and join me.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:00.610
Are you taking advantage of a woman by letting her go first?

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:02.530
No, that's not it at all.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:07.820
If you are from the Moonrace, why are you helping the Militia solders?

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:10.040
You're from the Moonrace too.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.330
My ancestors were.

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.830
After the spaceship has been excavated, what are you planning to do?

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:18.040
What am I planning? Doesn't it seem odd to you that those old fossilized items can even move?

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.420
I'm getting out.

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:22.420
An image plate?

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.420
Do you know who it is?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.010
That looks like the Will from a few generations before me.

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.140
I can't convince you not to leave on this journey?

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.640
I will return.

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.940
When that happens, please marry me.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:38.730
Of course. Please return to me safely.

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:42.940
Will decided to deny my request, and then left on his trip.

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:50.410
...And then Will's descendant also left us, riding away on a mobile suit he uncovered.

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.540
If you continue to assist our Dianna Counter...

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:56.540
We will consider sending you to the moon.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.130
If I may...Are you really Queen Dianna Soriel?

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:02.130
What?

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:06.130
The legend said my ancestor fell in love with the girl from the moon named Dianna Soriel.

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:09.510
But...you have the same name yet you don't seem to know anything about it.

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:14.640
Lieutenant Harry, Take this man to Commander Phil and give him a job.

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:22.520
I won't let you get in the way of my romance, Militia!

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:24.610
Lieutenant, watch this!

00:22:25.020 --> 00:22:29.450
The spacecraft in that valley will be used for the sake of meeting Dianna Soriel!

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:44.750
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:38.750 --> 00:22:44.750
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:51.260
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:44.750 --> 00:22:51.260
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:49.480
The pilot... is trying to get out?

00:22:50.300 --> 00:22:51.850
We should help him.

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:56.770
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:51.260 --> 00:22:56.770
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:56.730
But...I don't think those are anything but arms anymore, Milady.

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:57.810
You mean?

00:22:56.770 --> 00:23:00.770
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:56.770 --> 00:23:00.770
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:01.150
Mr. Will Game...

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:07.650
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:07.650
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:05.030
Loran...Loran...

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:09.320
What about Will? How's Mr. Will Game?

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:13.660
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:23:07.650 --> 00:23:13.660
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:12.740
Where's Will Game?

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:19.540
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:19.540
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.410
Loran...

00:23:16.040 --> 00:23:19.910
<i>As of now, no one knows how the romances of Loran and his friends will develop.</i>

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:24.520
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:24.520
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:25.380
<i>But as long as the truths of the Dark History remain a mystery...</i>

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:27.130
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:27.130
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:25.380 --> 00:23:28.390
<i>There will always be battles.</i>

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:34.760
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:34.760
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:41.140
<i>As the storm rages on...</i>

00:23:41.140 --> 00:23:43.650
<i>Many different and unexpected situations arise.</i>

00:23:43.650 --> 00:23:46.820
<i>Meanwhile, I helped Keith get across by becoming a bridge for him.</i>

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:52.820
<i>Elsewhere, while near the Soleil, I find myself trying to stop the Gozzo type mobile suits...</i>

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:55.530
<i>...and I also find Ms. Teteth.</i>

00:23:57.410 --> 00:23:59.620
<i>Next Time... on </i>Turn A Gundam...

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:01.210
Dust Blows On The Founding Of A Nation

00:24:01.830 --> 00:24:04.830
The deadly wind swirls and becomes a vicious twister.

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:07.170
<b>Dust Blows On The Founding Of A Nation</b>
